  "id": "korean-league-2026-victory-symbol-prizes",
  "name": "2026 Korean League Victory Symbol placing prizes",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Through the 2026 Korean League, the card game division's top players got the Item card Victory Symbol, printed with their event and placing: winners, runners-up and top 4 at Seasons 1 to 4 (29 November 2025 to 26 April 2026) and at the Final Season at COEX in Seoul on 24 and 25 May 2026. Winners' copies show a gold medal with Koraidon and Miraidon, runners-up a silver medal with Quaxly, Sprigatito and Fuecoco, and top 4 a bronze medal with Pikachu."
  },
